#: ../../source/references_visual-design.md:61
msgid "Font Selection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_visual-design.md:63
msgid ""
"**Use monospace fonts for all text.** Manim's Pango text renderer "
"produces broken kerning with proportional fonts (Helvetica, Inter, SF "
"Pro, Arial) at all sizes and resolutions. Characters overlap and spacing "
"is inconsistent. This is a fundamental Pango limitation, not a Manim bug."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_visual-design.md:65
msgid ""
"Monospace fonts have fixed character widths — zero kerning issues by "
"design."
msgstr ""

